{"3939400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nightmare Class Project", "steam_appid": 3939400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive through each day of your scholarship in this PSX-style game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet ambiguous people (and creatures), collect cosmetics, slide out of your dorm, uncover the secrets of this place or die trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/extras/c47e2a06a97a9acf6e8385351fec9747.poster.avif?t=1771508548\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/extras/c47e2a06a97a9acf6e8385351fec9747.webm?t=1771508548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/extras/c47e2a06a97a9acf6e8385351fec9747.mp4?t=1771508548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various places  in this retro 3d platformer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with many peculiar beings and learn  more about this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather key items to progress and discover secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some simple combat is involved, the place is crawling with dangers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cosmetics and equip combinations to your taste.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/extras/f72e2d3db4e58db0f933eddcc1419e32.poster.avif?t=1771508548\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/extras/f72e2d3db4e58db0f933eddcc1419e32.webm?t=1771508548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/extras/f72e2d3db4e58db0f933eddcc1419e32.mp4?t=1771508548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Grand Academy of Wizardry welcomes its new students for the year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graduate and become a great protector of Juwurumun, a nation who survived a war against a horrible dragon 300 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The school director himself defeated that said beast, his establishment has a reputation to uphold, failure is not an option, it's an insult!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But.. this place is clearly evil, will you be brave enough to investigate?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive through each day of your scholarship in this PSX-style game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet ambiguous people (and creatures), collect cosmetics, slide out of your dorm, uncover the secrets of this place or die trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/extras/c47e2a06a97a9acf6e8385351fec9747.poster.avif?t=1771508548\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/extras/c47e2a06a97a9acf6e8385351fec9747.webm?t=1771508548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/extras/c47e2a06a97a9acf6e8385351fec9747.mp4?t=1771508548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various places  in this retro 3d platformer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with many peculiar beings and learn  more about this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather key items to progress and discover secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some simple combat is involved, the place is crawling with dangers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cosmetics and equip combinations to your taste.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/extras/f72e2d3db4e58db0f933eddcc1419e32.poster.avif?t=1771508548\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/extras/f72e2d3db4e58db0f933eddcc1419e32.webm?t=1771508548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/extras/f72e2d3db4e58db0f933eddcc1419e32.mp4?t=1771508548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Grand Academy of Wizardry welcomes its new students for the year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graduate and become a great protector of Juwurumun, a nation who survived a war against a horrible dragon 300 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The school director himself defeated that said beast, his establishment has a reputation to uphold, failure is not an option, it's an insult!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But.. this place is clearly evil, will you be brave enough to investigate?</p>", "short_description": "Survive through each day of your scholarship in this PSX-style game. Meet ambiguous people (and creatures), collect cosmetics, slide out of your dorm, uncover the secrets of this place or d